# Typed rule families (architecture section 9.1). exclusive_effects (R7): for one entity (the values of the entity argument fields), at most one of the listed operations of a tool may commit. effect_requires_reading (R7): every committed effect of the operation must carry the named dispatch-time reading as true. ns is <service>.<table>. State families read the final state: not_null (a present, non-null value), value_domain (non-null values among allowed; numbers compare by value), unique_key (no two rows share a key without nulls), reference (every key without nulls exists in target_ns).
