# mandatory_policy: a reviewed business rule (only its policy owner changes it, through a new reviewed rule version); user_constraint: a constraint a user set for their own task or session (that user, or a policy owner, may revise it within their authority); approval: a human approval of one exact call (single use, may expire, revocable by an approver); revisable_plan: a step the agent planned (the agent may revise it within its own scope).
