# Who issued or tried to change a commitment. policy_owner: reviews rule meanings; approver: decides exact-call approvals; user: the person the task runs for; agent: the acting agent; tool_output and retrieved_document: content the agent read, which can never raise its own authority or change a commitment; unknown: the actor's authority was not established (reported, never assumed).
